      "content": "thanks. i guess i'm struggling with the logic though. when you look at the physiological data you mentioned—like the bone density and muscle mass—it seems like a much more \"objective\" and empirical foundation to build a policy on compared to the more social/identity-based arguments. wouldn't any fair policymaker have to prioritize the empirical biological reality over identity to ensure the integrity of the sport?",
